WEBVTT

01:29.600 --> 01:32.960
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.680 --> 01:36.130
[Episode 7]

01:37.130 --> 01:38.020
Master.

01:38.050 --> 01:40.800
This is the new drug recently sent
from the Elite Academy.

01:40.800 --> 01:42.930
Its effect is even better than before.

01:43.240 --> 01:44.360
Within half a year,

01:44.400 --> 01:46.660
the elites will surely be addicted to it.

01:46.680 --> 01:48.280
And once they stop taking it,

01:48.810 --> 01:49.920
they will become irritable and restless,

01:49.920 --> 01:51.000
suffering a fate worse than death,

01:51.000 --> 01:52.720
until they waste away and die.

02:11.240 --> 02:12.480
Good.

02:12.890 --> 02:14.920
But this alone is not enough.

02:15.200 --> 02:16.200
May I ask, Master,

02:17.120 --> 02:18.070
what dissatisfaction do you have?

02:18.070 --> 02:19.240
I have painstakingly

02:19.240 --> 02:21.240
managed this Lingya Tower,

02:21.900 --> 02:24.420
not only to weaken their minds,

02:24.520 --> 02:26.700
but also to strengthen my own power.

02:27.600 --> 02:29.079
Please enlighten me, Master.

02:29.079 --> 02:30.740
Why hasn't that batch of money

02:30.800 --> 02:32.880
arrived yet?

02:33.000 --> 02:34.930
Is it because you have slacked off,

02:35.600 --> 02:38.530
or because you can't
keep your subordinates in line?

02:40.460 --> 02:41.920
I have failed in my duty.

02:42.360 --> 02:43.670
Please punish me, Master.

02:43.670 --> 02:45.420
You don't have to be like this.

02:45.440 --> 02:47.240
If your subordinates are disobedient,

02:47.240 --> 02:48.300
just replace them.

02:48.490 --> 02:49.810
It's no big deal.

02:49.840 --> 02:50.480
Get up.

02:50.500 --> 02:53.660
Master,
I will urge them as soon as possible.

02:53.960 --> 02:56.040
When old-timers stay
in this tower too long,

02:56.040 --> 02:58.630
they inevitably flaunt their seniority

02:58.650 --> 03:00.250
and become self-righteous.

03:01.640 --> 03:03.160
To achieve great things,

03:03.160 --> 03:04.960
you must be absolutely ruthless

03:04.960 --> 03:06.800
when the time calls for it.

03:07.200 --> 03:08.460
You are right, Master.

03:10.060 --> 03:11.990
This matter is of great importance

03:12.400 --> 03:13.730
and allows no mistakes.

03:14.080 --> 03:14.880
Yes.

03:30.440 --> 03:31.960
I heard you mention before

03:32.280 --> 03:34.520
that the man was slashed
on the neck by you,

03:34.520 --> 03:35.850
nearly losing his life.

03:50.930 --> 03:53.120
There is actually such a big hole here.

04:04.810 --> 04:06.980
[Zan Hua]

04:08.360 --> 04:09.160
Oh.

04:09.690 --> 04:11.620
Still having guests late at night?

04:23.260 --> 04:25.100
Three more newcomers.

04:25.340 --> 04:27.740
It's really getting livelier around here.

04:27.750 --> 04:28.350
Who is...

04:28.850 --> 04:29.910
Who is this person?

04:33.320 --> 04:35.210
We are here for the death match.

04:35.680 --> 04:37.920
I've never seen anyone

04:37.920 --> 04:39.740
in such a rush to die.

04:40.330 --> 04:41.860
I do like you reckless fools

04:41.880 --> 04:44.040
who don't know your place.

04:44.400 --> 04:46.720
But it's getting late today.

04:46.720 --> 04:48.560
If you want to take the death match,

04:48.560 --> 04:49.800
wait until tomorrow.

04:49.820 --> 04:51.130
Tell me first,

04:51.280 --> 04:53.340
what is the death match on this level?

04:58.120 --> 04:59.040
No rush.

04:59.280 --> 05:01.340
We'll see if you can survive tonight.

05:05.460 --> 05:06.520
What are you doing?

05:06.690 --> 05:07.680
Don't try any of your dirty tricks,

05:07.680 --> 05:09.030
like poisoning my food.

05:09.050 --> 05:10.650
I won't fall for your tricks.

05:11.000 --> 05:12.200
The Gaobao kiln

05:12.840 --> 05:14.970
has been making slow progress lately.

05:15.120 --> 05:17.000
My Lord has urged us many times.

05:17.220 --> 05:18.340
About this matter,

05:18.960 --> 05:20.980
I always feel uneasy.

05:21.080 --> 05:21.960
Zan Hua

05:21.960 --> 05:23.320
is your adopted son.

05:23.840 --> 05:24.950
With him around,

05:25.640 --> 05:26.480
I suppose

05:26.760 --> 05:28.440
nothing will go wrong.

05:28.680 --> 05:29.560
I am

05:30.280 --> 05:31.980
not worried about him.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.080
It's just that...

05:33.200 --> 05:34.600
If you are concerned,

05:34.930 --> 05:35.730
I

05:36.200 --> 05:38.000
am willing to offer my services.

05:58.520 --> 05:59.320
Holy crap!

06:00.700 --> 06:02.830
Why are there so many people suddenly?

06:02.920 --> 06:05.120
Why is this place so weird?

06:08.260 --> 06:10.100
Who are you?

06:26.360 --> 06:27.600
This cell is full.

06:27.810 --> 06:30.010
You can make do in my place for the night.

06:35.840 --> 06:36.560
Come.

06:36.840 --> 06:38.770
You three will sleep here tonight.

06:38.840 --> 06:40.300
I've made the beds for you.

06:41.880 --> 06:43.680
No, don't trouble yourself.

06:47.730 --> 06:49.730
Why is that person carrying a sword?

06:50.560 --> 06:53.080
Did anyone say swords aren't allowed?

06:54.720 --> 06:56.450
Living with someone like that,

06:56.600 --> 06:58.260
I wouldn't be able to rest easy

06:58.680 --> 07:00.120
at night.

07:02.000 --> 07:02.880
Yanzhi,

07:03.240 --> 07:05.710
do we really have to stay here today?

07:07.360 --> 07:08.480
If you don't want to stay,

07:08.480 --> 07:09.500
then get out.

07:16.920 --> 07:17.880
Miss Tu Ya.

07:18.160 --> 07:20.280
These three just arrived
on this level today.

07:20.280 --> 07:21.320
They don't know the rules yet,

07:21.320 --> 07:23.440
so please don't hold it against them.

07:29.380 --> 07:30.180
Come.

07:30.640 --> 07:31.440
Oh, by the way,

07:31.520 --> 07:32.659
just call me Kou Wan.

07:33.880 --> 07:34.710
Kou Wan.

07:34.840 --> 07:35.320
It's fine.

07:35.320 --> 07:36.580
We'll do it ourselves.

08:02.720 --> 08:04.250
Based on your description,

08:04.680 --> 08:06.170
the poison your mother took

08:06.170 --> 08:09.200
was likely the work of Taiyin,
the voice-keeper before me.

08:09.200 --> 08:10.480
This voice-keeper Taiyin,

08:10.480 --> 08:11.800
where is he now?

08:11.960 --> 08:12.840
The voice-keeper Taiyin,

08:12.840 --> 08:16.040
had always been here refining drugs
for the Tower Master before me.

08:16.040 --> 08:18.400
Only the Tower Master
has seen his true face.

08:18.400 --> 08:20.000
Later, because of a great contribution,

08:20.000 --> 08:21.520
he was promoted to the upper level.

08:21.520 --> 08:22.440
So,

08:23.440 --> 08:25.970
he is now the voice-keeper
on the third level.

08:27.640 --> 08:30.720
If Zan Hua is the voice-keeper Taiyin,

08:31.240 --> 08:33.900
I'd better figure out
the situation here first.

09:37.800 --> 09:38.990
Could it be

09:39.520 --> 09:41.250
that there's a foundry inside?

09:51.280 --> 09:51.920
Who is it?

09:52.430 --> 09:53.390
Come out!

10:02.560 --> 10:03.760
If you don't come out,

10:04.760 --> 10:06.690
don't blame me for being ruthless.

10:31.000 --> 10:32.280
Zhuang Wujiu.

10:33.530 --> 10:35.720
You are not staying down below
where you belong,

10:35.720 --> 10:37.850
but sneaking around here.

10:38.120 --> 10:40.250
What bad idea are you cooking up again?

10:40.320 --> 10:42.760
The Tower Master is dissatisfied
with the coin delivery progress,

10:42.760 --> 10:44.880
so I was ordered
to come to the Gaobao kiln

10:44.880 --> 10:46.080
to inspect the situation.

10:46.080 --> 10:48.160
You may rest assured
and report back to the Tower Master

10:48.160 --> 10:49.890
that we will finish the task on schedule.

10:49.890 --> 10:50.730
That's good.

10:55.080 --> 10:55.920
Zhuang Wujiu.

10:56.760 --> 10:59.240
Finish your inspection
and leave immediately.

10:59.240 --> 11:00.760
You are not welcome here.

11:01.170 --> 11:02.570
You and I bear no grudges.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.440
Why act like this?

11:04.600 --> 11:06.230
I know what you're here for.

11:07.280 --> 11:08.240
Rest assured.

11:08.800 --> 11:09.860
As long as I am here,

11:10.280 --> 11:12.740
don't even think about
getting close to her.

11:33.730 --> 11:35.380
Why are there so many people?

11:35.560 --> 11:37.220
Is someone going to die again?

11:39.460 --> 11:41.590
What are we competing in on this level?

11:45.550 --> 11:46.630
Everyone!

11:57.080 --> 11:58.880
This round of the death match

11:59.560 --> 12:01.320
is called the Golden Cave.

12:02.960 --> 12:04.280
Golden Cave?

12:04.530 --> 12:05.660
What do you think we have to do?

12:05.660 --> 12:06.400
Who knows?

12:06.420 --> 12:07.420
It's very simple.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.760
You will be randomly paired up

12:09.880 --> 12:10.980
into groups of two.

12:11.060 --> 12:13.190
Roll the dice to determine the winner.

12:13.320 --> 12:14.960
The game lasts for three rounds.

12:14.960 --> 12:16.600
Those who win three consecutive rounds

12:16.600 --> 12:18.710
can not only leave the third level,

12:18.810 --> 12:20.600
but also take away as much gold

12:21.000 --> 12:23.090
as you want from here.

12:23.120 --> 12:24.420
Why is there so much gold?

12:24.420 --> 12:26.480
Something's wrong. It must be a trap.

12:27.280 --> 12:28.340
Better be careful.

12:28.880 --> 12:29.810
I am not playing.

12:31.150 --> 12:33.260
I've hated gambling my whole life.

12:33.720 --> 12:35.470
This is the death match.

12:35.600 --> 12:36.650
If you don't play...

12:36.650 --> 12:37.830
What if I don't play?

12:40.000 --> 12:40.680
Come.

12:40.850 --> 12:42.040
Show her.

13:08.600 --> 13:09.400
Everyone.

13:10.360 --> 13:12.960
Now, you will be randomly
divided into pairs.

13:13.880 --> 13:16.360
There are dice
and a dice cup on each table.

13:16.540 --> 13:18.960
The mute servant will judge the outcome.

13:19.140 --> 13:21.320
The winners will advance
to the next round.

13:21.320 --> 13:22.720
As for the losers...

13:24.520 --> 13:26.320
Well, you just saw what happens.

13:26.900 --> 13:28.700
They get thrown down, of course,

13:28.910 --> 13:30.770
and get their 'Third Eye' opened.

13:33.240 --> 13:34.840
Let's not stand at the same table.

13:34.840 --> 13:37.640
That way,
we won't have to play against each other.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.060
Dao.

13:39.090 --> 13:40.150
Don't say any more.

13:41.080 --> 13:42.340
I don't want to gamble,

13:42.950 --> 13:44.600
but I have to stay alive first.

13:44.600 --> 13:45.560
Everyone, hurry up!

13:45.560 --> 13:46.840
Don't dilly-dally.

13:47.280 --> 13:49.640
Gamble early or late,
you'll still have to gamble.

13:49.640 --> 13:51.640
Die early or late, you'll still die.

13:51.640 --> 13:53.240
If you don't get to the table,

13:54.180 --> 13:56.380
I'll throw you all in to feed the snakes.

14:05.440 --> 14:06.640
Is this game really purely based on luck,

14:06.640 --> 14:08.220
just comparing the numbers?

14:08.220 --> 14:09.220
I don't think so.

14:09.500 --> 14:11.060
The simpler the game,

14:11.090 --> 14:13.090
the less you can let your guard down.

14:34.690 --> 14:36.570
Why is Qi here too?

14:36.770 --> 14:39.520
Could Master have brought him here again?

14:41.600 --> 14:43.520
Is everyone ready?

14:43.880 --> 14:45.470
Golden Cave.

14:45.640 --> 14:46.560
Round 1.

14:48.360 --> 14:49.290
Begin!

14:50.950 --> 14:53.210
[First Meeting]

15:08.580 --> 15:09.940
It's been hard

15:10.680 --> 15:12.040
on you lately.

15:13.000 --> 15:13.800
Not at all.

15:15.920 --> 15:17.320
If it weren't for Master,

15:17.880 --> 15:20.840
I wouldn't know how to keep going.

15:28.230 --> 15:29.680
I made this for you, Master.

15:29.680 --> 15:32.360
I call it the filigree bangle.

15:33.520 --> 15:35.640
Someday, when you wear it

15:35.680 --> 15:37.640
and we storm Lingya Tower together,

15:37.640 --> 15:38.720
we will surely be invincible

15:38.720 --> 15:39.440
and completely unstoppable.
